Subject: [PATCH] gstreamer: depend on GLib's object system instead of GTK

Backport of https://github.com/ptitSeb/box64/pull/4528 to v0.4.4
(2f130fab1d6e1a4ee8a71dc60cfdfcc839ad192a). The wrapper uses GLib's
object system through gtkclass.c but makes no GTK calls.

diff --git a/src/wrapped/wrappedgstreamer.c b/src/wrapped/wrappedgstreamer.c
--- a/src/wrapped/wrappedgstreamer.c
+++ b/src/wrapped/wrappedgstreamer.c
@@ -1489,6 +1489,6 @@
     SetGstURIHandlerID(my->gst_uri_handler_get_type());        \
     SetGstBufferPoolID(my->gst_buffer_pool_get_type());        \
 
-#define NEEDED_LIBS "libgtk-3.so.0"
+#define NEEDED_LIBS "libgobject-2.0.so.0", "libglib-2.0.so.0", "libgmodule-2.0.so.0"
 
 #include "wrappedlib_init.h"
